The font files in this directory are subsets of Noto Sans CJK SC and
Noto Sans Mono CJK SC, distributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

They are committed here so the WebUI browser gate renders the same glyphs on
every machine. The visual baselines compare pixels, and a glyph rasterized
from a host's installed font moves thousands of pixels when the installed set
changes, even though no WebUI source changed. The gate therefore loads only
the files in this directory; see
`scripts/lib/webui-font-environment.mjs`.

Upstream: https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk
License: https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk/blob/main/LICENSE

These are subsets. Each file keeps only the glyphs the WebUI client can
render, so the committed size stays small. The subsets were produced with
fontTools from the upstream release; the upstream licence above governs them.